#!/bin/bash
# maestro through sim-dibs: without --device/--udid, runs on this terminal's leased
# device (the --platform one, else the only one it holds); a named device must be
# ours. list-devices, cloud and help pass through.
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/_lib.sh"
real=$(real_tool maestro)
[ -n "$real" ] || { echo "sim-dibs shim: maestro not found." >&2; exit 127; }
[ -n "${SIM_DIBS_BYPASS:-}" ] && exec "$real" "$@"

device="" platform="" cmd="" prev=""
for a in "$@"; do
  case "$prev" in --device|--udid) device="$a" ;; -p|--platform) platform="$a" ;; esac
  case "$a" in
    --device=*|--udid=*) device="${a#*=}" ;;
    -p=*|--platform=*) platform="${a#*=}" ;;
    -*) ;;
    *) case "$prev" in --device|--udid|-p|--platform) ;; *) [ -n "$cmd" ] || cmd="$a" ;; esac ;;
  esac
  prev="$a"
done
case "$cmd" in ""|list-devices|list-cloud-devices|cloud|login|logout|download-samples|bugreport|mcp|chat) exec "$real" "$@" ;; esac

if [ -n "$device" ]; then
  IFS=, read -ra ids <<< "$device"
  for d in "${ids[@]}"; do check_target "$d"; done
  exec "$real" "$@"
fi
t=$(target_for "$(printf '%s' "$platform" | tr 'A-Z' 'a-z')"); rc=$?
[ $rc = 3 ] && exit 3
[ $rc = 0 ] || exec "$real" "$@"
exec "$real" --device="${t#* }" "$@"
